    "5,5": "The cottage door.",
    "26,8": "The tavern door, warm light behind it.",
    "7,7": "Up the lane: home. East: the square. South, past the forge: what is left of the old tavern.",
    "16,9": "The town well. The rope is new; the stones are very old.",
    "29,2": "The north road, closed with a rope. Someone has hung a lantern on it, so you can see the way back.",
    "17,5": "The temple door is shut."
